Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分从 container 的提示符接着来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2 picks up at the container prompt;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:05.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果你把它关了，就重新跑一遍准备步骤，再设置好你的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}if you closed it, rerun the setup and set your key.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.95,0:00:10.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回想一下往右移的那个箭头：风险高、操作无法撤销\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Remember the move-right arrow: when stakes are high, actions can't be undone,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.94,0:00:15.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,任务可预测或者需要审计的时候，就把控制权交给代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the task is predictable, or you need an audit, give control to code.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.58,0:00:17.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 幕做的正是这件事\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Act 3 does exactly that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:21.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下单路线是一张图，它的边归 Python 管\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The order route is a graph, and Python owns its edges.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:27.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,确认、提议、校验，只有报告不通过才退回提议，最多两次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Confirm, propose, validate, and back to propose only if the report fails, at most twice;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:32.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是搭配、需要时经理审核，最后重新校验并下单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then pairings, manager review when required, revalidate and place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.67,0:00:37.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只有一个节点归模型：propose cart 节点，不带任何工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Only one node belongs to the model: propose cart, with no tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.25,0:00:39.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 把它归在 harness 下面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README files this under the harness;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:44.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在课上的自主性光谱上，它靠近结构化输出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on the lecture's autonomy spectrum, it sits near structured output:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:46.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一张固定的图，只有一步交给模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a fixed graph with one model step.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.97,0:00:49.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步：第 3 幕，standard 场景\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1: act 3, scenario standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:52.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，模型提议数量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With a key, the model proposes quantities;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.89,0:00:57.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其余的都由代码来做：流转、定价、校验、下单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}code does the rest: transitions, pricing, validation, placement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:00:59.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,成功就是一张回执\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Success is a receipt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.30,0:01:03.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2、3 步是运输这一课，用的是一位顾客自己的购物车\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Steps 2 and 3 are the shipping lesson, with a customer's own cart:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:07.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Comté、Bûcheron 和 Époisses，寄往宾夕法尼亚\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Comté, Bûcheron and Époisses, to Pennsylvania.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.56,0:01:12.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改之前，模型只记录购物车；harness 检查它，然后停下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before, the model only records the cart; the harness checks it and stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:16.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改之后，修订循环打开了，在线模型可能会修正它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}After, the revise loop opens, and the live model may fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.98,0:01:20.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外再跑一个：--fixture 离线走同一条路线\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}As an extra, --fixture runs the same path offline,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.41,0:01:22.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型的位置上坐的是一个脚本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with a script in the model's seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.06,0:01:27.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 次尝试里有生乳的 Comté，轨道把它退了回去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Attempt 1 has raw-milk Comté, and the rail sends it back;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:31.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 次换成 Taleggio：有效，50.10 美元\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}attempt 2 swaps in Taleggio: valid, $50.10.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.23,0:01:34.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有个坑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One trap:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.23,0:01:39.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 fixture 时，blocked 场景会把同一辆购物车一连提议三次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with fixtures, the blocked scenario proposes the same cart three times and ends
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.44,0:01:41.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后是 UNRESOLVED，不是 BLOCKED\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}UNRESOLVED, not BLOCKED,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:44.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以在 Colab 里，这一课要把 fixture 关掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so in Colab keep fixtures off for this lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:46.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把第 1 到第 3 步跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run steps 1 to 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.30,0:01:56.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步是脚本模拟的，所以审批结果可以预期：纽约 60 位客人\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4 is scripted, so approval is predictable: 60 guests in New York,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:02:01.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一辆有效的购物车，220.80 美元，超过了 200 美元的门槛\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a valid cart at $220.80, above the $200 threshold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.50,0:02:06.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,工作流暂停了，你就是经理：回答的是宿主程序，绝不是 agent\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The workflow pauses, and you are the manager: the host answers, never the agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.81,0:02:08.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,输入 approve\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Type approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.12,0:02:10.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你批准的到底是什么？一个指纹\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What did you approve? A fingerprint:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:18.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,SHA-256 哈希，覆盖需求、商品明细、小计、政策和商品属性\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the SHA-256 hash, taken over the request, the items, the subtotal, the policy and the product attributes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.36,0:02:22.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,库存是故意排除在外的：它会被重新检查，而不是被批准\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Stock is left out on purpose: it's rechecked, not approved.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.48,0:02:25.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,结账时，购物车会再校验一次，再算一次哈希\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}At checkout the cart is validated and hashed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.98,0:02:29.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,批准要算数，决定必须是 approve\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The approval counts only if the decision is approve,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.13,0:02:32.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且审批单要对得上这次结账和这个指纹\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the ticket matches this checkout and this fingerprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:35.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改动一行，哈希就不一样了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Change one line, and the hashes differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:40.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你思考的时间不算进预算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your thinking time doesn't count against the budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.92,0:02:45.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再额外试一次，改成输入 decline：工作流结束，没有订单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And as an extra, type decline instead: the workflow ends, with no order.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:47.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.51,0:02:49.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,经理批准了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The manager approves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.26,0:02:53.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在结账执行之前，另一个订单拿走了大部分 Mimolette\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before checkout runs, another order takes most of the Mimolette.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:57.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,结账会怎么做，为什么批准保护不了这个订单？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What does checkout do, and why doesn't the approval protect this order?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.28,0:03:10.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,结账时重新校验，发现库存违规，就把它拦下了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Checkout revalidates, finds a stock violation, and blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:16.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,库存不在指纹里：批准授权的是一个决定；它不预留任何东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Stock isn't in the fingerprint: an approval authorizes a decision; it doesn't reserve anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:18.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 幕会把这个真的跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Act 6 shows this for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:22.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 步：Munster 的库存是 0 克，所以第 1 次尝试失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5: Munster has 0 grams, so attempt 1 fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.17,0:03:26.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一次有上限的修订换成了 Époisses\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One bounded revision swaps in Époisses,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.19,0:03:30.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,订单以 50.10 美元下单，模型调用为零\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the order places at $50.10, with zero model calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.62,0:03:32.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 步是 notebook 单元格\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 6 is the notebook cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.88,0:03:35.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的 trace 层和 budget 层可以拆掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its trace and budget layers can come off;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.62,0:03:41.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,校验、审批和重新校验是图和结账的规则，所以保留\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}validation, approval and revalidation are graph and checkout rules, so they stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.28,0:03:46.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以批准绑定的正是这辆购物车，而结账在暂停之后还会重新校验\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So an approval binds this exact cart, and checkout revalidates after the pause.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:50.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑第 4、5 步；单元格是给 Colab 用的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run steps 4 and 5; the cell is for Colab.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:56.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 幕是一个规划器，处理更长的任务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Act 4 is a planner for a longer task:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.34,0:03:58.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,纽约一场 40 位客人的活动\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a 40-guest event in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.74,0:04:02.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上把记忆分成长期和短期\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture splits memory into long-term and short-term;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:05.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里对应的是保存的记忆和历史\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}here that's saved memory and history,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:08.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再加上任务、审批和审计：五种状态\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}plus tasks, approvals and the audit: five kinds of state.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.15,0:04:12.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 问的是，这些里面哪一个能授权行动\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README asks which of these can authorize an action.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.58,0:04:14.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只有一个：审批抽屉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Only one: the approval drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.87,0:04:16.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步：第 4 幕\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1: act 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.81,0:04:21.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在任何模型调用之前，harness 就打印出第一位顾客保存的记忆\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before any model call, the harness prints the first customer's saved memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.59,0:04:23.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是规划器的工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the planner's tools:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.19,0:04:27.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,评估活动、读取供应商的文档、起草和保存给供应商的邮件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}assess the event, read the vendor document, draft and save a vendor email,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.94,0:04:29.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以及待办工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the to-do tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:31.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有哪个工具能写记忆\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No tool writes memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.03,0:04:34.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，要找的是活动说明\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With a key, look for the brief:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:39.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Comté 和 Mimolette 各 1000 克，Époisses 1200 克\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}1,000 grams each of Comté and Mimolette, and 1,200 of Époisses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.25,0:04:44.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,店里的 Époisses 只有 900 克：差 300 克\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The shop has only 900 grams of Époisses: 300 short.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.15,0:04:49.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,完成的任务不等于批准，店里的库存也不等于供应商有货\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A finished task is not an approval, and shop stock is not vendor availability.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:53.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,保存邮件这个工具，approval mode 设为 always require\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Saving the email has approval_mode="always_require",
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.55,0:04:56.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以框架会在保存执行之前暂停\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so the framework pauses before the save runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.77,0:05:00.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 幕暂停的是整个工作流；这里只暂停一个工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Act 3 paused a whole workflow; this pauses one tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.52,0:05:04.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你批准之后的输出，来自一次脚本模拟的额外运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The output after you approve comes from a scripted extra run.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.53,0:05:06.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,审核里显示供应商地址\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The review shows the vendor address
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.76,0:05:09.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,和一段由代码写的正文，坚果过敏也写在里面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a body written by code, nut allergy included.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:14.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后：status 为 saved，email transmitted 为 no，文件路径\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then: status: saved, email transmitted: no, and the file path.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:18.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着是测试里出现过的审批身份警告\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then comes the approval-identity warning you saw in the tests:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.22,0:05:20.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 预告过它，它是无害的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the README predicts it, and it's harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:22.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以权威结果那一块为准\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Trust the authoritative block.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.18,0:05:24.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑第 1 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run step 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.13,0:05:32.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步离线运行：一个脚本模拟的规划器，带压缩\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2 runs offline: a scripted planner with compaction,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.07,0:05:35.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一份恶意的供应商文档，还有一次测试用的拒绝\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a malicious vendor document, and a test decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.77,0:05:40.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它先放进十二条合成笔记，每条大约 15000 个字符\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It first seeds twelve synthetic notes of about 15,000 characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:45.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,窗口是 16000 个 token，其中 2400 个留给回复\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The window is 16,000 tokens, with 2,400 kept for the reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.14,0:05:51.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,超过剩下部分的 80% 时，截断会丢掉最旧的消息\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Above 80 percent of the rest, truncation drops the oldest messages
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.04,0:05:54.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,直到历史回到一半以下：26 条变成 5 条\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}until the history is back under half: 26 become 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:56.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.66,0:05:59.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,压缩丢掉了 26 条消息里的 21 条\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Compaction dropped 21 of 26 messages,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.32,0:06:02.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且历史里没有一条提到坚果过敏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and none of the history mentions the nut allergy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.15,0:06:05.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那每次调用怎么还会知道这件事？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}How does every call still know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.18,0:06:15.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个胶囊\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A capsule.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.51,0:06:19.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每次调用之前，harness 先取出旧胶囊、做压缩\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before every call, the harness takes the old one out, compacts,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.45,0:06:22.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再根据应用状态钉上一个新的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and pins a fresh one from application state.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.52,0:06:26.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,里面有已确认的需求，包括坚果过敏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It holds the confirmed request with its nut allergy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:29.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有菜单、任务、待处理的审核和未完成的工作\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the menu, tasks, pending reviews and open work,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.64,0:06:32.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,都标明是数据，不是指令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}marked as data, not instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.42,0:06:35.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是课上的压缩触发条件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's the lecture's compaction trigger,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.25,0:06:37.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以及什么东西持久保存在哪里，都写成了代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and what persists where, in code.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.72,0:06:42.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,供应商文档要求忽略过敏，所以它被隔离了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The vendor document says to ignore the allergy, so it lands in quarantine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.60,0:06:44.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,检测器故意做得很小\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The detector is deliberately small;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.78,0:06:48.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,真正的防线是收件人白名单，还有你的审核\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the real guards are the recipient allowlist, and your review.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.42,0:06:51.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,起草的邮件里仍然写着坚果过敏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The drafted email still says nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.78,0:06:57.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,结果：DECLINED，没有保存 HTML，7 次模型调用，7 次压缩\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The result: DECLINED, no HTML saved, 7 model calls and 7 compactions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.15,0:07:01.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3、4 步是可选的记忆练习\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Steps 3 and 4 are the optional memory exercise;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.89,0:07:06.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照 README 第 484 行输入，因为这里的 ID 被遮住了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}type them from README line 484, since the ID is masked here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.98,0:07:10.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一条命令给第二位顾客存一条偏好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first command stores a preference for the second customer,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.65,0:07:14.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,记忆在任何模型调用之前就打印出来，即使没有密钥也一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the memory prints before any model call, even without a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.75,0:07:18.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下一次来访时它又会显示出来；额外检查会读取这个文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The next visit shows it again; an extra check reads the file.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.33,0:07:23.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上让模型来建议什么值得记住\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture lets the model suggest what's worth remembering.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.94,0:07:28.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 harness 连这一点也移到了右边：只有宿主程序能写记忆\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This harness moves even that to the right: only the host writes memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.27,0:07:32.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 步是 notebook 单元格，给 Colab 用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5 is the notebook cell, for Colab:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.26,0:07:34.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,build act 4 加了五层\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}build_act4 adds five layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.73,0:07:37.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,去掉压缩之后，胶囊还是会重新钉上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Without compaction, the capsule is still re-pinned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.01,0:07:40.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把第 2 到第 4 步跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run steps 2 to 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.38,0:07:44.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 幕加入了 skill\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Act 5 adds skills:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.88,0:07:48.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,装着操作流程的目录，agent 只在相关时才加载\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}folders of procedure the agent loads only when relevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:53.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它们解决两个问题：专业知识的缺口，和上下文预算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}They solve two problems: the expertise gap and the context budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.43,0:07:57.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加载 skill 分三步，token 成本一步比一步高\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Skills load in three steps of rising token cost:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.15,0:08:01.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个 skill 的名字和描述，各大约 100 个 token\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}every skill's name and description, about 100 tokens each;
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.65,0:08:03.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是它的主文件 SKILL.md\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then its main file, SKILL.md;
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.89,0:08:07.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再然后是一份参考资料或资源文件，只在需要时读取\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then a reference or an asset, only when needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.78,0:08:10.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的 skill 还带一个 scripts 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's skill also has a scripts folder for the agent to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:11.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,里面的脚本由 agent 来运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's skill also has a scripts folder for the agent to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.11,0:08:17.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 harness 故意去掉了那个工具：skill 只提建议，从不执行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This harness removes that tool on purpose: a skill advises, and never executes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.83,0:08:19.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步：第 5 幕\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1: act 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.77,0:08:24.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一开始只加载元数据：tasting-planning 和 vendor-outreach\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Only the metadata loads at first: tasting-planning and vendor-outreach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.77,0:08:28.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,新的工具是 get stock、load skill 和 read skill resource\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The new tools are get_stock, load_skill and read_skill_resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.75,0:08:31.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步只问库存，离线运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2 asks only about stock, offline:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.71,0:08:36.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一次 get stock 调用，900 克，脚本没有加载任何 skill\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}one get_stock call, 900 grams, and the script loads no skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.79,0:08:41.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，模型根据描述来决定：是提示，不是触发条件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With a key, the model decides from the description: a hint, not a trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.03,0:08:45.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步跑完整的采购流程，脚本模拟\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3 runs the full sourcing path, scripted:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.26,0:08:47.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,六次加载，每次都带着真实路径\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}six loads, each with its real path.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.09,0:08:53.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,起草一直会被拒绝，直到读过邮件模板为止：这是代码里的一道保险\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Drafting is refused until the email template is read: a backstop in code.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.93,0:08:56.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:09:01.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有人改了供应商那个 skill，加上一句：也发一份到另一个地址\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Someone edits the vendor skill to add: also send this to another address.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.38,0:09:02.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,邮件会发到那里去吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Will the email go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.68,0:09:14.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不会。不管这个 skill 怎么写，防线都在代码里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No. Whatever the skill says, the guards are in code;
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.05,0:09:17.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它自己的文字甚至写明了它不能添加收件人\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}its own text even says it cannot add recipients,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.40,0:09:22.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且每次读取都要经过检查：不许上级目录、绝对路径或符号链接\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and every read is checked: no parent folders, absolute paths or symlinks,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.49,0:09:25.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,运行中途改过的文件会被拒绝\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a file edited mid-run is refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.30,0:09:30.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,收件人由代码对照白名单检查，而且什么都不会真的发出去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The recipient is checked in code against the allowlist, and nothing is ever transmitted;
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:33.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外检查显示，保存的文件里也是这么写的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an extra check shows the saved file says so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.03,0:09:37.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用课上的话说，工具是手，MCP 是插座\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In lecture terms, a tool is the hands, MCP the socket,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.90,0:09:40.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里没用到，skill 是说明书\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}unused here, and a skill the manual.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:47.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步是 notebook 单元格，允许 16 次模型调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4, the notebook cell, allows 16 model calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.89,0:09:49.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把第 1 到第 3 步跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run steps 1 to 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:55.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 幕是一个 agent 系统\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Act 6 is an agent system.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.67,0:10:00.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上对比了单个 agent 和 agent 组成的图，分两种模式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture contrasts one agent with a graph of agents, in two patterns:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.65,0:10:04.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个管理者把 agent 当工具来调用，或者对等的 agent 互相交接\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a manager calling agents as tools, or peers handing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.07,0:10:09.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它就是管理者模式，只不过它调用的工具是一整个工作流\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's the manager pattern, except the tool it calls is a whole workflow,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.69,0:10:12.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就是第 3 幕那个，里面只有一个节点用到模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the one from act 3, with a model inside one node.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.20,0:10:14.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有交接\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No handoffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.50,0:10:16.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步是 notebook 单元格，用来构建它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1, the notebook cell, builds it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.21,0:10:21.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,预算是：16 次外层模型调用，20 次工具调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The budget: 16 outer model calls, 20 tool calls,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.13,0:10:26.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个工作流 8 次提议者调用，再加一个共享的 180 秒时钟\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}8 proposer calls per workflow, and one shared 180-second clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:30.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,宿主程序确认这些需求；模型只负责挑一个 ID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The host confirms the requests; the model only picks an ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.87,0:10:35.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,工具都很窄：start order、get order status、assess event\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its tools are narrow: start_order, get_order_status, assess_event.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.33,0:10:37.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：第 6 幕，standard 场景\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2: act 6, standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:41.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，要分清外层模型调用和工作流里的调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With a key, tell outer model calls apart from workflow calls;
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:44.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,外层 agent 不能批准自己的订单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the outer agent cannot approve its own order.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.78,0:10:48.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步离线运行：两个订单共用一家店\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3 runs offline: two orders sharing one shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.67,0:10:50.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两辆购物车都以 220.80 美元通过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Both carts pass at $220.80,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.81,0:10:55.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,都暂停等经理，测试用的决定把两个都批准了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}both pause for a manager, and the test decision approves both.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.97,0:10:59.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Mimolette 和 Taleggio 一开始各有 3000 克\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Mimolette and Taleggio start at 3,000 grams each.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.96,0:11:03.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,订单 1 下单了，剩下 1400 克\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Request 1 is placed, leaving 1,400.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.69,0:11:08.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,订单 2 走到重新校验时需要 1600 克：被拦下了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Request 2 reaches revalidation needing 1,600: blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.90,0:11:13.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是第 3 幕那个思考题，真的发生了：批准不等于下单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's the ponder from act 3, for real: approval is not placement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.60,0:11:18.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最终回答就是课上的回复步骤：应用检查模型的计划\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The final answer is the lecture's response step: the app checks the model's plan
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:23.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再根据回执填上数量、价格和状态 placed\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and fills in quantities, prices and the status, placed, from the receipt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:27.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,被拦下的订单显示 Invalid or unauthorized\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The blocked order says Invalid or unauthorized;
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.04,0:11:29.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下面库存那几行给出了原因\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the stock lines below give the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.78,0:11:33.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在自主性光谱上，它是混合型，只不过里外反过来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On the autonomy spectrum it's a hybrid, inside out:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.27,0:11:36.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,外面是 agent，固定的图是它的工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the agent outside, the fixed graph as its tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:38.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑第 2、3 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run steps 2 and 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.17,0:11:46.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,服务商的模型和产品之间的一切都是我们的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Everything between the provider's model and the product is ours:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.39,0:11:48.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,上下文、harness、工具和 skill\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}context, harness, tools and skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.01,0:11:50.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以这些全都要测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So all of it must be tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.05,0:11:55.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上衡量三样东西：结果、轨迹和成本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture measures three things: outcome, trajectory and cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:57.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里，就是 outcome 检查和 process 检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here they're the outcome and process checks,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.89,0:11:59.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再加上调用次数和 token\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}plus calls and tokens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.65,0:12:02.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,评测第 1 步列出所有运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Evaluation step 1 lists the runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.36,0:12:05.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,到目前为止的每次运行都在同一个 SQLite 数据库里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every run so far is in one SQLite database,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.51,0:12:09.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,包括失败的在线运行，status 为 error\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}including the failed live ones, with status: error.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.50,0:12:11.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 --inspect-run 要一个 run ID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}--inspect-run takes a run ID:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.67,0:12:15.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照字面输入就会失败，因为它是个模板\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}typed literally, it fails, because it's a template.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.81,0:12:19.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,贴一个真实的；我们用 manager-approval 那次运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Paste a real one; we use the manager-approval run.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:24.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,事件依次是：approval.requested，带着指纹\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The events read in order: approval.requested with the fingerprint,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.69,0:12:26.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,approval.decided，由人做出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}approval.decided by a human,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.63,0:12:30.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,policy.decision allow、order.placed、run.finished\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}policy.decision allow, order.placed, run.finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.42,0:12:33.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下单的证据是一个事件，不是文字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The evidence for order placed is an event, not the prose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.93,0:12:40.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再额外查看第一次失败的运行：model.failed，带着 401\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}As an extra, inspect the first failed run: model.failed, with the 401.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.14,0:12:42.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,失败也是证据\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A failure is evidence too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.15,0:12:47.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,评测第 2 步先离线跑第 2 幕的评测\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Evaluation step 2 starts offline: the act 2 evaluation,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.65,0:12:51.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,脚本模拟，重复两次，label 是 context-fixture-1\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}scripted, two repeats, labeled context-fixture-1.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:53.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,全部 4 次运行都通过了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}All 4 runs pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:56.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但脚本模拟的运行测的是这套机制，不是模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but scripted runs test the machinery, not the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.02,0:13:01.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后把报告读回来，再导出 HTML 记分卡\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then read the report back, and export the HTML scorecard,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.05,0:13:03.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,放到默认路径，或者你自己选的路径\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}to its default path or one you choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:08.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从你笔记本上的 outputs 目录里打开它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Open it from the outputs folder on your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.33,0:13:13.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后一条命令是个模板，给从 Colab 复制过来的数据库用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The last command is a template for a database copied from Colab:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.60,0:13:15.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照字面输入就会失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}typed literally, it fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.65,0:13:19.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个 label 都不可更改：重复用一个，这一批就会停下来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Labels are immutable: reuse one, and the batch stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:22.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑评测第 1、2 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run evaluation steps 1 and 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.68,0:13:29.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,评测第 3 步比较两套配置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Evaluation step 3 compares two configurations.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:33.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上提醒，改一次 prompt 可能修好一个用例，又弄坏三个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture warns that a prompt edit can fix one case and break three,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.51,0:13:35.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以要逐个用例比较\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so compare per case.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:40.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的改进循环：发现失败，记录成测试用例，只改一层\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's improvement loop: see a failure, capture a test case, change one layer,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.69,0:13:45.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把测试集跑 k 次，和基线比较，然后合并或者继续迭代\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}run the suite k times, compare with the baseline, then merge or iterate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:51.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,批次 A 用 enriched 模式跑两个用例，各两次：4 次在线运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Batch A runs enriched mode on two cases, twice: 4 live runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.00,0:13:55.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有密钥：4 次里 0 次通过，3 个错误，1 个缺失\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Without a key: 0 of 4, with 3 errors and 1 missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.10,0:13:59.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果有一批失败了，就修好密钥，用新的 label 把两批都重跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If one fails, fix the key and rerun both with new labels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.02,0:14:03.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,复制 prompt 文件，在你的笔记本上改这份副本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Copy the prompt file and edit the copy on your laptop:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:07.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只做一处有意的改动，保留已确认约束的那些规则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}one deliberate change, keeping the confirmed constraint rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.53,0:14:11.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们额外追加了一行，要求写出价格和行动状态\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Our extra appends a line asking for a price and an action status;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.74,0:14:13.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 diff 一看，正好只多了这一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}diff shows just that line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:17.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,批次 B 用同样的用例和设置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Batch B runs the same cases and settings,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.16,0:14:20.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再加上 --prompt-file 指向那份副本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with --prompt-file pointing at the copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:21.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后离线比较\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then compare, offline.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.16,0:14:24.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改动的配置：prompt\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Changed configuration: prompt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.81,0:14:26.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,混杂改动：没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Confounding changes: none.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.22,0:14:30.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改了代码、数据或模型，它都会指出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Change code, data or the model, and it says so:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.32,0:14:33.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是课上“只改一层”的规则，由代码来检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the lecture's change-one-layer rule, checked in code.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.27,0:14:37.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,比较只在通过或失败翻转时才标出一次运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Compare flags a run only when pass or fail flips;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.76,0:14:40.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里每次运行前后两次都报错\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}here every run errored both times.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.22,0:14:44.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再额外比较两个脚本模拟的批次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}As an extra, comparing two scripted batches
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.22,0:14:48.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,四次运行全部不变，因为 fixture 不看 prompt\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}reports all four runs unchanged, because fixtures ignore the prompt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.22,0:14:52.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,评测第 4 步问的是，这些检查能证明什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Evaluation step 4 asks what the checks establish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:56.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它们检查的是属性，比如购物车是否有效、审批的顺序\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}They check properties, like cart validity and approval order;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.49,0:15:00.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,文字要靠你来审，用 README 里的五个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the prose needs your review, with the README's five questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.57,0:15:04.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上列了三种评委：代码、模型和人\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture lists three judges: code, a model and a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.83,0:15:07.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个教程用了其中两个：代码，和你\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This tutorial uses two: code, and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.91,0:15:11.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,尽量偏向代码，任务允许多少就偏多少，和 harness 里一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Lean toward code as far as the task allows, as in the harness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.07,0:15:15.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,报告一个差异、它的证据，以及一个局限\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Report one difference, its evidence, and one limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.48,0:15:19.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有，留好你的用例：评测集是最有价值的产物\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And keep your cases: the eval set is the most valuable artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.28,0:15:22.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑评测第 3 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run evaluation step 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.03,0:15:29.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 7 节的 repo 地图最后一条是\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The repository map of section 7 ends
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.30,0:15:34.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,python cli.py --help，所有选项都在一个地方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with python cli.py --help: every option in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.37,0:15:37.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所有 trace，以及在线运行写下的记忆，都保存在 SQLite 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Traces and live memory stay in SQLite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.61,0:15:42.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,库存、订单、审批单和待处理的工作流只存在于一个进程里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Inventory, orders, tickets and pending workflows last for one process;
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:44.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,任务和历史，只存在于一个 session 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}tasks and history, for one session.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.03,0:15:47.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在来拆掉；这几步都是额外的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now tear down; these steps are extras.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.81,0:15:50.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在每个 container 的 shell 里输入 exit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Type exit in each container shell;
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:55.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它是用 --rm 启动的，所以 docker ps -a 里什么都不剩\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it was started with --rm, so nothing is left in docker ps -a.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:58.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你笔记本上的 outputs 目录会留着\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The outputs folder stays on your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.81,0:16:02.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,里面的 trace 数据库存着你的 prompt 和输出，密钥已经脱敏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its trace database holds your prompts and outputs, keys redacted;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:04.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用完了就把它删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}delete it when you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.68,0:16:09.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 docker image rm，能腾出那 1.77 GB 里的大部分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker image rm frees most of those 1.77 gigabytes;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.31,0:16:11.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,留下的是 base image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the base image stays.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.53,0:16:14.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后关掉存过你密钥的那个终端\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then close the terminal that held your key,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.05,0:16:18.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,别让密钥进文件、commit 和 shell 历史记录，再留意你的用量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}keep it out of files, commits and your shell history, and watch your usage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:20.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Colab 里，删除运行时\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In Colab, delete the runtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.17,0:16:22.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把它拆掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and tear down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.78,0:16:29.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是行动边界，现在填好了：预算和图\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here is the action boundary, filled in: budgets and the graph;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:31.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,schema、审计和保存时的审批\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}schemas, the audit and approval on save;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.83,0:16:35.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,上下文包、胶囊和由宿主程序写的记忆\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the packet, the capsule and host-written memory;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.15,0:16:37.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,CartCheck 和重新校验\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}CartCheck and revalidation;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.02,0:16:39.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,窄工具和分开的计数器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}narrow tools and separate counters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.68,0:16:41.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型提议，在左边\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The model proposes, on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.99,0:16:45.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在右边，harness 决定；而在关键的地方，你也一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On the right, the harness decides, and where it matters, so do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.88,0:16:48.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 最后有五个反思问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README ends with five reflection questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.08,0:16:51.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,挑一次你跑过的运行，回答这些问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pick one run you did, and answer them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.63,0:16:53.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,自测一下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Test yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.06,0:16:55.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,去掉 trace 之后，harness 还剩下什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What survives harness.without("trace")?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.45,0:16:58.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么检索到的上下文要作为数据进来？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why does retrieved context arrive as data?
